{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And it shall be:</b> Human beings will not know, when the day of YHWH comes, whether it is day or night; and near evening this will become clear. And those who interpret it allegorically concerning the exile and the deliverance — it is not correct; rather, it is according to its plain sense."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:47:00.646022458Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}